('u5_04_snorkelling_meaning','vocab_snorkelling','u5_04_snorkelling','snorkelling_1','meaning_context','We spent the morning snorkelling above the coral reef and saw dozens of colourful fish.',null,'["swimming with a mask and tube"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
